      "@type": "cat-harness:Tool",
      "description": "A review-process task moves one `review-comment/1.0.0` todo's status (address, send back, resolve, adjudicate, withdraw) through `transition()`, which refuses any move the named BPMN task may not make. The comment is written to the folio's todos graph (its declared `todo-feedback` directory) and, with `--commit`, committed to the edit-set's FEATURE branch. Refused on the base branch and on a detached HEAD.",
